<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Cable Co 1996 loss widens to 36 mln riyals.</title>
<headline>Saudi Cable Co 1996 loss widens to 36 mln riyals.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Loss		     36.0   vs     7.5 loss</p>
<p> Sales income	  103.6   vs    91.4</p>
<p> Expenses		110.9   vs    99.2</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 447.9   vs   483.8</p>
<p> Assets		1,422.6   vs 1,505.1</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Cable Company.</p>
<p>Note - The company is traded in the Saudi stock market. It said it had received permission from the Commerce Ministry to increase its paid-in capital by 200 million riyals to 500 million riyals. It plans to offer shares worth 100 million riyals to shareholders and would later issue bonus shares worth another 100 million riyals.</p>
</text>
